      "claimUnderReview": "Window of C7-a(i) is not this artifact.",
      "measurement": "The frozen Stage A subject does not define a C7-a(i) Window. basedOn.d293.role identifies component-manifest leftover-join.v12 as limb C7-a(ii) and identifies OD-1 owner assignment as the later split limb C7-a(i). obligations[OBL-OD-1].reason repeats that OD-1 owner assignment is a later split limb (C7-a(i)). D-293 Decision 7 C7 supplies the two distinct owner decisions: OD-1 owner assignment and OD-2 final do-not-fold. The draft reproduces the OD-2 warrant and the OD-1 non-assignment boundary, but replaces the source's defined process noun limb with Window.",
      "whyShouldFix": "If adopted verbatim, the permanent coordinator record would introduce an undefined process category at the exact sentence separating this OD-2 act from the later OD-1 owner-assignment act. Window is especially misleading here because reserved windows and numeric values are separate decision material elsewhere in the same programme. The surrounding operative boundaries are correct, so this does not rise to MUST-FIX, but an authority recital should use the frozen source's exact split-limb terminology.",
      "requiredRepair": "In a refrozen successor draft, replace the sentence with `The C7-a(i) limb is not this artifact.` or an exact equivalent using `split limb`. Preserve the existing D-293 Decision 7 C7 OD-2 warrant, OD-1 UNASSIGNED standing, prohibition on assigning the owner or inventing numbers, and all zero-readiness boundaries.",
      "whyNotMustFix": "The Decision section independently says that the act does not assign OD-1's owner, does not invent OD-1 numbers, and records only the OD-2 final do-not-fold disposition. No owner, value, Class A opening, SATISFIED state, or implementation authority is actually created by the noun error.",
      "doesNotRequire": "No edit to component-manifest-leftover-join.v12, either Stage A review, either frozen predecessor, fixture bytes, file 08, live COORD, D-293, required-now, or any identifier is required. This review intentionally returns the finding unlabeled and invents no finding identifier.",
      "primaryEvidence": [
        "component-manifest-leftover-join.v12 basedOn.d293.role: `component-manifest leftover-join.v12 is limb C7-a(ii) of that adoption. OD-1 owner assignment is a later split limb (C7-a(i)) and is not this artifact.`",
        "component-manifest-leftover-join.v12 obligations[OBL-OD-1].reason: `OD-1 owner assignment is a later split limb (C7-a(i)).`",
        "D-293 Decision 7 C7 records OD-1 under DR-115 Product + release engineering authority and OD-2 as a final do-not-fold disposition; it does not define a C7-a(i) Window.",
        "A fixed-string search of the pre-review source corpus found `Window of C7-a(i)` only in this D-304 draft; excluding this review artifact, the frozen subject instead uses `limb C7-a(i)` at both controlling sites."
